      "side": 1,
      "message": "The ~80 number is just snapshot for the design, I did add the word \"Today\", so no, we don\u0027t need to update this doc as that number changes. \n\nThere is no check today that keeps test tools out of dependencies. We just need to catch them at reviews.  This one was caught early but the MR I created was stacked on the doc MR and got too far out of date so I created a new MR.",
